# ── Model weights ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub hard-rejects files over 100 MB. The backdoored checkpoint is 255 MB and
# the archive is 235 MB, so both are excluded by pattern. Config and tokenizer
# files are deliberately NOT matched, so the checkpoint folder's shape and its
# hyperparameters stay visible and reviewable in the repo.
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
backdoor_model.zip

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The pipeline only ever reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment; nothing
# is written to disk. These patterns exist so that stays true.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*credentials*

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
